  "term": "phencyclidine",
  "definition": "Phencyclidine is a hallucinogenic drug, also known as PCP or Angel Dust, that was once used as an anesthetic in veterinary medicine and briefly in humans. It is related to ketamine in structure and effects and can cause a dissociative state.",
